// Windows resources. The FIRST icon in the file is the one Explorer, the
// taskbar and the Inno Setup shortcuts pick up, so the application icon has
// to lead - hence the low ordinal rather than a name.
//
// This is the same artwork the Qt resource carries, as a multi-resolution
// .ico: Windows chooses per surface (16px in the title bar, 32 in the task
// switcher, 256 in the large-icon view) and, unlike QIcon, will happily
// stretch a single size when the one it wants is absent.
1 ICON "icons/flow-gui.ico"
